From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: owner <owner@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:39:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] Smartfill fork: the build goes by its own name, Taviri

The product name is one setting, webpack/smartfill-brand/brand.json. The build
writes it into the extension name, short name, toolbar and sidebar titles; the
description says the build is based on Bitwarden; the in-page notice of the
fill steps reads the name from the built manifest.

- Icons in smartfill-brand/images replace upstream's at build time
  (placeholder set until the brand kit exists).
- The built extension carries LICENSE_GPL.txt and a NOTICE.txt saying it is an
  unofficial, modified build of the Bitwarden browser extension.
- Firefox add-on id: browser-extension@taviri.invalid.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
