+# Brand of this fork
+
+Everything that names or pictures this build lives in this folder.
+
+- **`brand.json`**: `name` is the one setting for the product name. The build writes it into the
+  extension's name, short name, toolbar title and sidebar title, and the description says it is
+  based on `basedOn`. The in-page notice of the fill steps reads the name from the built manifest.
+  `firefoxAddonId` is the Firefox add-on id; changing it makes Firefox see a different add-on.
+- **`images/`**: toolbar and extension icons. Files here replace the files of the same name in
+  `src/images` at build time: `icon16.png`, `icon32.png`, `icon48.png`, `icon96.png`,
+  `icon128.png` (each also as `_gray`, shown when logged out), `icon19.png`, `icon38.png` (also as
+  `_gray` and `_locked`). The current set is a placeholder until the brand kit exists.
+- **`NOTICE.txt`**: copied into the built extension next to `LICENSE_GPL.txt`.
+
+After a change, rebuild. `SMARTFILL_BRANDING=off` builds with upstream's name and icons.
